@startuml teranode block assembly pipeline

title Block Assembly Pipeline - Spend the UTXO
hide footbox

participant "Event Bus" as eventbus <<external>>
participant "UtxoSpendHandler" as utxospendhandler <<pipeline>>
participant "UtxoStorage\n(write only)" as utxostorage <<component>>

|||
loop message consumed by UtxoStorage ( utxoSpendMsg )
|||
    |||
    note over utxospendhandler
        UTXO verifies that coin is accepted and not
        yet spent in the given tmplTipId chain by
        some other transaction.

        AOL Record to spend the utxo is added to the AOL.
    end note
    |||
    eventbus o--> utxospendhandler :  consume utxoSpendMsg
    activate utxospendhandler
        utxospendhandler --> utxostorage : utxoSpendMsg\nsent for processing
        activate utxostorage
            utxostorage --> utxostorage : doSpendUtxo
            utxostorage --> utxospendhandler : return spendResponseData
        deactivate utxostorage
        utxospendhandler --> utxospendhandler : create ReturnUtxoSpendMsg
        utxospendhandler --> eventbus : publish ReturnUtxoSpendMsg
    deactivate utxospendhandler
|||
end loop
@enduml
